      "https://tucson.com/news/local/article_393f70cc-caff-11e7-81a6-23d948b26ce8.html",
      "https://ktar.com/?p=1836607"
     ]
    },
    {
     "claim": "K_roof",
     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "The van's roof could be raised and lowered (hinged per the Tucson Sentinel; a sliding roof per El Universal, via NPR) so the cannon could be raised to fire from inside the vehicle; an air compressor, a gasoline engine and a compressed-air tank were found with it. Narration: 'The roof opened, for a shot at Arizona.' (purpose as reported by the authorities: a shot = firing over the fence). Callout 'AIR CANNON IN THE ROOF / Compressor, engine, air tank'.",
